Motherly Fact-Checking Standards		<p>Every piece of content at Motherly is created with care, compassion, and a commitment to accuracy. Our team ensures that every article, guide, and insight reflects the highest standards of medical integrity, clarity, and empathy. To learn how we maintain trustworthy, evidence-based information that supports your parenting journey, explore our content review principles.</p><!-- ============================================================
     MOTHRLY — Postpartum Care in Chennai
     FINAL with Sticky TOC Sidebar
     Paste into ONE WordPress Custom HTML block
     ============================================================ -->
<style>
:root {
  --red:      #8B1A1A;
  --red-mid:  #9B2335;
  --cream:    #FAF3F0;
  --cream-b:  #F0E6DF;
  --green:    #3a7a4a;
  --text:     #1a1a1a;
  --muted:    #666666;
  --border:   #E2D0C8;
  --white:    #ffffff;
  --r:        8px;
  --rlg:      12px;
}
/* ── Page Layout ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.mb-wrap {
  display: flex;
  gap: 32px;
  max-width: 1160px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  align-items: flex-start;
  position: relative;
}
/* ── Main Content ───────────────────────────────────────────── */
.mb {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  font-family: inherit;
  color: var(--text);
  line-height: 1.8;
  font-size: 17px;
  background: var(--white);
}
.mb *, .mb *::before, .mb *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
.mb p { margin: 0 0 1.2rem; color: var(--text); }
.mb ul, .mb ol { margin: 0 0 1.2rem 1.6rem; padding: 0; }
.mb li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.75; }
.mb strong { font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); }
.mb a { color: var(--red); text-decoration: underline; }
.mb a:hover { color: var(--red-mid); }
/* ── Headings ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.mb h1 { font-family: inherit; font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.4rem); font-weight: 700; color: var(--red); line-height: 1.2; margin: 0.4rem 0 1.1rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
.mb h2 { font-family: inherit; font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 1.65rem); font-weight: 700; color: var(--red); margin: 2.6rem 0 0.9rem; padding-bottom: 0.45rem; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--cream-b); line-height: 1.3; scroll-margin-top: 24px; }
.mb h3 { font-family: inherit; font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.2rem); font-weight: 700; color: var(--red-mid); margin: 1.8rem 0 0.5rem; line-height: 1.3; }
.mb h4 { font-family: inherit; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin: 0 0 0.4rem; }
/* ── Post Meta ──────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.mb-meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; align-items: center; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 1.1rem; padding-bottom: 1rem; border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--cream-b); }
.mb-cat { background: var(--cream); color: var(--red); padding: 4px 14px; border-radius: 20px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; border: 1px solid var(--cream-b); }
/* ── Fact Check ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.mb-fact { display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start; background: var(--cream); border: 1px solid var(--cream-b); border-radius: var(--r); padding: 1rem 1.3rem; margin: 1.4rem 0 1.8rem; }
.mb-fact-icon { background: var(--green); color: #fff; width: 22px; height: 22px; min-width: 22px; border-radius: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 2px; flex-shrink: 0; }
.mb-fact-body { font-family: inherit; font-size: 16px; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.7; }
.mb-fact-body strong { color: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
/* ── Intro Lead ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.mb-lead { font-family: inherit; font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.08rem); color: var(--text); line-height: 1.9; background: var(--cream); border-left: 3.5px solid var(--red); padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 0 var(--r) var(--r) 0; margin-bottom: 1.8rem; }
/* ── Pull Quote ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.mb-quote { font-family: inherit; font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.15rem); font-style: italic; color: var(--red-mid); background: var(--cream); border-left: 3.5px solid var(--red); padding: 1rem 1.5rem; margin: 1.8rem 0; border-radius: 0 var(--r) var(--r) 0; line-height: 1.75; }
/* ── Service Cards ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
.mb-services { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; margin: 1.4rem 0 2.2rem; }
.mb-sc { background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--rlg); padding: 1.3rem 1.4rem; border-top: 3px solid var(--red); }
.mb-sc h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 0 0 10px; color: var(--red-mid); border: none; padding: 0; }
.mb-sc-label { font-family: inherit; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.09em; color: var(--muted); margin: 12px 0 5px; }
.mb-sc p { font-family: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text); margin: 0 0 6px; }
/* ── Coverage Table ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
.mb-table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; margin: 1.4rem 0 2.2rem; border-radius: var(--rlg); border: 1px solid var(--border); -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }
.mb-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15.5px; min-width: 480px; }
.mb-table th { background: var(--red); color: #fff; padding: 11px 15px; text-align: left; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
.mb-table td { padding: 11px 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--text); vertical-align: top; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 400; }
.mb-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
.mb-table tr:nth-child(even) td { background: var(--cream); }
.mb-table td:first-child { font-weight: 700; color: var(--red-mid); white-space: nowrap; }
.mb-table .td-ok { color: var(--text); font-weight: 400; font-size: 15px; }
/* ── Trust List ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.mb-trust { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 9px; margin: 0.7rem 0 1.6rem; }
.mb-trust-item { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px; font-family: inherit; font-size: 16px; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.55; }
.mb-trust-item::before { content: '✓'; font-weight: 700; color: var(--green); min-width: 16px; margin-top: 1px; flex-shrink: 0; }
/* ── Food Table ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.mb-food-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-family: inherit; font-size: 16px; margin: 1rem 0 1.8rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--rlg); overflow: hidden; }
.mb-food-table tbody tr { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
.mb-food-table tbody tr:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.mb-food-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) td { background: var(--cream); }
.mb-food-table tbody tr:nth-child(odd) td { background: var(--white); }
.mb-food-table td { padding: 11px 15px; vertical-align: top; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--text); font-weight: 400; }
.mb-food-table td:first-child { font-weight: 700; color: var(--red); width: 38%; }
/* ── Warning Boxes ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
.mb-warn-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; margin: 1.4rem 0 2.2rem; }
.mb-warn { border-radius: var(--rlg); padding: 1.2rem 1.3rem; }
.mb-warn.physical { background: #FFF9F0; border: 1px solid #EDD0A0; border-top: 3px solid #B8860B; }
.mb-warn.emotional { background: var(--cream); border: 1px solid var(--cream-b); border-top: 3px solid var(--red); }
.mb-warn h4 { font-family: inherit; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin: 0 0 10px; }
.mb-warn.physical h4 { color: #8B6914; }
.mb-warn.emotional h4 { color: var(--red); }
.mb-warn ul { margin: 0; padding: 0 0 0 14px; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--text); }
.mb-warn li { margin-bottom: 6px; }
/* ── Steps ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.mb-steps { margin: 1.4rem 0 2.2rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
.mb-step { display: flex; gap: 15px; align-items: flex-start; background: var(--cream); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--rlg); padding: 1.1rem 1.3rem; }
.mb-step-num { font-family: inherit; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; background: var(--red); border-radius: 50%; width: 42px; height: 42px; min-width: 42px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; }
.mb-step-body h4 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 2px 0 5px; color: var(--red-mid); }
.mb-step-body p { font-family: inherit; font-size: 16px; color: var(--text); margin: 0; line-height: 1.7; }
/* ── CTA ────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.mb-cta { background: var(--red); color: #fff; border-radius: var(--rlg); padding: 2rem 1.8rem; text-align: center; margin: 2.4rem 0; }
.mb-cta h3 { font-family: inherit; font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 3vw, 1.5rem); color: #fff; margin: 0 0 0.6rem; border: none; padding: 0; line-height: 1.3; }
.mb-cta p { font-family: inherit; font-size: 16px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.88); margin: 0 0 1.3rem; }
.mb-cta-btn { display: inline-block; background: #fff; color: var(--red); font-family: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; padding: 11px 34px; border-radius: 30px; text-decoration: none; }
.mb-cta-btn:hover { background: var(--cream); color: var(--red); }
.mb-cta-sub { font-family: inherit; font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); display: block; margin-top: 11px; }
/* ── FAQ ────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.mb-faq { margin: 1.4rem 0 2.4rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--rlg); overflow: hidden; }
.mb-faq-item { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
.mb-faq-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.mb-faq-q { font-family: inherit; font-size: clamp(15px, 2vw, 17px); font-weight: 600; color: var(--text); padding: 1rem 1.3rem; cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; background: var(--white); transition: background 0.15s; user-select: none; line-height: 1.45; }
.mb-faq-q:hover { background: var(--cream); }
.mb-faq-icon { font-size: 20px; color: var(--red); min-width: 20px; text-align: center; transition: transform 0.22s; flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1; }
.mb-faq-a { font-family: inherit; font-size: 16px; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.8; padding: 0 1.3rem; max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; transition: max-height 0.35s ease, padding 0.2s ease; }
.mb-faq-item.open .mb-faq-a { max-height: 600px; padding: 0.5rem 1.3rem 1.2rem; }
.mb-faq-item.open .mb-faq-icon { transform: rotate(45deg); }
.mb-faq-item.open .mb-faq-q { background: var(--cream); color: var(--red); }
/* ── Tags ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.mb-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin: 1.6rem 0; }
.mb-tag { font-family: inherit; font-size: 14px; background: var(--cream); color: var(--red-mid); padding: 4px 14px; border-radius: 20px; text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid var(--cream-b); }
.mb-tag:hover { background: var(--cream-b); }
/* ── Author Bio ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.mb-author { display: flex; gap: 15px; align-items: flex-start; background: var(--cream); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--rlg); padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem; margin: 1.5rem 0; }
.mb-author-avatar { width: 50px; height: 50px; min-width: 50px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--red); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: inherit; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; flex-shrink: 0; }
.mb-author-info h4 { font-family: inherit; font-size: 16px; color: var(--red-mid); margin: 0 0 4px; }
.mb-author-info p { font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; color: var(--muted); margin: 0; line-height: 1.65; }
/* ── Divider ────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.mb hr { border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); margin: 2rem 0; }
/* ── STICKY TOC SIDEBAR ─────────────────────────────────────── */
.mb-toc {
  width: 240px;
  min-width: 240px;
  position: sticky;
  top: 24px;
  max-height: calc(100vh - 48px);
  overflow-y: auto;
  background: var(--white);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--rlg);
  padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem;
  align-self: flex-start;
}
.mb-toc-title {
  font-family: inherit;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  padding-bottom: 8px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.mb-toc ul {
  list-style: none;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}
.mb-toc ul li {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}
.mb-toc ul li a {
  display: block;
  font-family: inherit;
  font-size: 13.5px;
  color: var(--muted);
  text-decoration: none;
  padding: 6px 8px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  line-height: 1.45;
  transition: background 0.15s, color 0.15s;
  border-left: 2px solid transparent;
}
.mb-toc ul li a:hover {
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--red);
  border-left-color: var(--red);
}
.mb-toc ul li a.toc-active {
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--red);
  font-weight: 600;
  border-left-color: var(--red);
}
/* scrollbar styling for TOC */
.mb-toc::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 4px; }
.mb-toc::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
.mb-toc::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--border); border-radius: 4px; }
/* ── Responsive ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .mb-toc { display: none; }
  .mb-wrap { display: block; }
}
@media (max-width: 700px) {
  .mb-trust { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .mb-services { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .mb-warn-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .mb-food-table td:first-child { width: 45%; }
}
@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .mb { font-size: 16px; }
  .mb-meta { font-size: 13.5px; }
  .mb-lead { padding: 1rem 1.1rem; font-size: 1rem; }
  .mb-quote { padding: 0.9rem 1.1rem; }
  .mb-cta { padding: 1.6rem 1.2rem; }
  .mb-cta-btn { padding: 10px 24px; font-size: 16px; }
  .mb-step { gap: 12px; }
  .mb-step-num { width: 36px; height: 36px; min-width: 36px; font-size: 16px; }
  .mb-fact { flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .mb-author { flex-direction: column; }
  .mb-food-table { font-size: 14.5px; }
  .mb-food-table td { padding: 9px 11px; }
}
</style>
<!-- ── OUTER WRAPPER: sidebar + content side by side ── -->
  <!-- ── MAIN CONTENT ── -->
  <article>
    <h2 id="toc-0">Postpartum Care in Chennai: The Complete Guide for New Mothers</h2>
    <!-- INTRO -->
      You just brought your baby home from the hospital. The nurses are gone. The doctors are gone. Your husband has gone back to work. Your mother-in-law means well but gives conflicting advice. And you — exhausted, healing, breastfeeding every two hours — are wondering: <em>where do I find real, professional help? Who provides postpartum care near me, in Chennai, that I can actually trust?</em>
    <p>If you live in Chennai and you are searching for postpartum care near you, this guide was written for you. It covers what postnatal care actually means, why it matters, what services are available in Chennai, which areas Motherly's certified professionals cover, and how to book the right support in minutes.</p>
    <p>Postnatal care in Chennai is no longer a luxury available only to wealthy families. Through Motherly — Chennai's trusted maternal care platform — every family can access certified doulas, lactation consultants, postnatal nannies, and gynaecologists, available across the city and bookable through one simple app.</p>
    <!-- SECTION 1 -->
    <h2 id="toc-1">What Is Postpartum Care and Why Does Every Chennai Mother Need It?</h2>
    <p>Postpartum care — also called postnatal care — is the professional, physical, emotional, and practical support a mother and baby receive in the weeks and months after delivery. It is the answer to everything the hospital discharge does not cover.</p>
    <p>When mothers search for postnatal care near them in Chennai, they are typically looking for one or more of the following:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Someone to help with breastfeeding challenges</li>
      <li>A trained nanny or caregiver for the newborn</li>
      <li>A gynaecology consultation for postnatal recovery</li>
      <li>Emotional support during postpartum depression or anxiety</li>
      <li>A doula to provide continuous companionship through the transition</li>
    </ul>
    <p>The postpartum period — known as the fourth trimester — is one of the highest-risk windows in a woman's physical and mental health. In India, where structured postnatal support is almost entirely absent from the public health system, mothers in Chennai who find and book professional postnatal care are taking a genuinely life-changing step.</p>
    Searching for postpartum care near me in Chennai is not a sign of weakness. It is the most informed, loving thing a new mother can do for herself and her baby.
    <!-- SECTION 2 -->
    <h2 id="toc-2">What Does Postpartum Care in Chennai Include?</h2>
    <p>Postnatal care covers a wide range of services depending on what a mother needs. Here is what comprehensive support near you in Chennai includes when you book through Motherly:</p>
        <h3>Doula Services — Emotional &amp; Physical Support</h3>
        Why You Need It
        <p>A postpartum doula provides continuous emotional support, helps with breastfeeding, assists with newborn care, and simply sits with you through the beautiful chaos of early motherhood.</p>
        What Motherly Provides
        <p>Certified, vetted postpartum doulas across Chennai — North, Central, South, and West. Book a single session or ongoing weekly support through the Motherly app.</p>
        <h3>Lactation Consultant Services in Chennai</h3>
        Why You Need It
        <p>Breastfeeding difficulties are one of the primary reasons mothers seek postnatal help. A certified lactation consultant provides hands-on latch assessment, milk supply planning, pumping guidance, and support for mastitis, low supply, or nipple pain.</p>
        What Motherly Provides
        <p>Certified IBCLCs and trained lactation professionals for home visits across Chennai. Book within 24 hours through the Motherly app.</p>
        <h3>Postnatal Nannies &amp; Newborn Care</h3>
        Why You Need It
        <p>A postnatal nanny is the practical backbone of new-mother support — providing trained newborn care (bathing, feeding support, sleep routines) so the mother can rest and recover.</p>
        What Motherly Provides
        <p>Trained and background-checked postnatal nannies for day duty, night duty, and full-time care across all major Chennai areas.</p>
        <h3>Gynaecology Consultations for Postnatal Recovery</h3>
        Why You Need It
        <p>Postnatal gynaecology consultations cover wound assessment (C-section or perineal), hormonal health, postpartum weight, contraception, and screening for postpartum depression.</p>
        What Motherly Provides
        <p>Verified gynaecologists in Chennai for in-clinic or teleconsultation postnatal appointments, including experienced Chennai-based women's health specialists.</p>
        <h3>Postpartum Mental Health Support</h3>
        Why You Need It
        <p>1 in 5 new mothers experience postpartum depression — and in Chennai, most go undiagnosed due to stigma. Comprehensive postnatal care always includes emotional wellbeing support.</p>
        What Motherly Provides
        <p>All Motherly professionals are trained to identify early signs of postpartum depression and connect mothers with appropriate resources as part of every care package.</p>
    <!-- SECTION 3 -->
    <h2 id="toc-3">Postpartum Care Near Me — Areas We Cover Across Chennai</h2>
    <p>Motherly's network of certified professionals covers all major areas of Chennai — from Perambur in the north to Tambaram in the south, from Porur in the west to OMR in the east.</p>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Zone</th>
            <th>Localities Covered</th>
            <th>Services Available</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>North Chennai</td>
            <td>Perambur, Tondiarpet, Villivakkam, Kolathur, Madhavaram, Ambattur</td>
            <td>Doulas · Lactation · Nannies · Gynaecology</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Central Chennai</td>
            <td>T.Nagar, Nungambakkam, Egmore, Mylapore, Triplicane, Kilpauk, Chetpet</td>
            <td>All Motherly Services</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>South Chennai</td>
            <td>Adyar, Velachery, Tambaram, OMR, Sholinganallur, Perungudi, Pallavaram</td>
            <td>All Motherly Services</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>West Chennai</td>
            <td>Porur, Vadapalani, Anna Nagar, Koyambedu, Valasaravakkam, Virugambakkam</td>
            <td>Doulas · Lactation · Nannies · Gynaecology</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Extended Chennai</td>
            <td>Chromepet, Medavakkam, Guduvanchery, Poonamallee, Avadi, Thiruvanmiyur</td>
            <td>Doulas · Lactation · Nannies · Gynaecology</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    <p>If your area is not listed, contact us — our network is growing across Greater Chennai. Visit <a href="https://mothrly.com" target="_blank">mothrly.com</a> or call us to check availability in your locality.</p>
    <!-- SECTION 4 -->
    <h2 id="toc-4">Why Motherly Is Chennai's Most Trusted Postpartum Care Platform</h2>
    <p>When you search for postnatal care near you in Chennai, you will find many options — informal networks, domestic agencies, hospital referrals, and online listings. Here is why thousands of Chennai mothers choose Motherly:</p>
    <h3>Every Professional Is Vetted and Verified</h3>
      Background checks for all nannies and care professionals
      Certification verification for lactation consultants and gynaecologists
      Training in newborn care, safe handling, and postnatal support
      Ongoing quality monitoring and mother feedback review
    <h3>Book Postpartum Care Near Me in 2 Minutes</h3>
      Browse professionals by area, service type, and availability
      Read verified profiles before booking
      Instant WhatsApp confirmation after booking
      Available on Android and iOS — free to download
    <h3>Care That Feels Like Family</h3>
      Chosen for warmth and empathy, not just qualifications
      Continuous support — not just one visit
      Culturally sensitive to Chennai and Tamil Nadu traditions
      Available for both vaginal delivery and C-section recovery
    <!-- SECTION 5 -->
    <h2 id="toc-5">Traditional Postpartum Practices in Chennai — What the Old Wisdom Gets Right</h2>
    <p>Postpartum care in Tamil Nadu has deep roots. Traditional practices — the <em>patthu</em> (45-day rest), the oil bath and massage, the prescribed diet of <em>kali</em> and legume-based foods, the gingelly oil body massage for the baby — represent generations of accumulated wisdom about recovery, nutrition, and bonding.</p>
    <p>Motherly's approach honours these traditions while complementing them with evidence-based professional support. Our professionals understand that a Chennai mother receiving postnatal care may be navigating between her paati's advice, her gynaecologist's instructions, and her own exhausted intuition — and they are trained to work within this cultural reality, not against it.</p>
    <!-- SECTION 6 -->
    <h2 id="toc-6">Postpartum Nutrition in Chennai — What to Eat for Recovery</h2>
    <p>Nutrition is a cornerstone of postnatal recovery. In Chennai, postpartum diet traditions are rich and deeply practical — and most align well with modern nutritional science. Here is what Motherly recommends:</p>
    <table>
      <tbody>
