        <tr><td>Pal kozhukattai and sesame-jaggery preparations</td><td>— calcium and iron for recovery and milk supply.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Drumstick (moringa) sambar daily</td><td>— clinically proven to increase milk supply. Essential in postnatal nutrition.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Garlic-infused ghee on rice</td><td>— prolactin stimulation through everyday cooking.</td></tr>
