      <tr><td>Oats and Dalia</td><td> iron and beta-glucan to stimulate prolactin. The breakfast foundation of recovery.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Methi (Fenugreek) seeds</td><td> the most researched galactagogue. Soak 1 tsp overnight and eat with water each morning.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Moringa (drumstick) leaves</td><td> clinically proven to increase milk supply. Add to dal or soup daily.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Garlic</td><td> 2–3 cloves in daily cooking. Stimulates prolactin and the let-down reflex.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Masoor and moong dal</td><td> iron and protein at every meal. Essential while recovering from C-section.</td></tr>
