  <h2 id="toc-9">You Are Doing Better Than You Think</h2>
  <p>Learning how to increase breast milk is not a sign of failure — it is a sign of how deeply you care. Most supply concerns resolve with the right support, the right nutrition, and the right professional guidance. Every mother who asks how to increase breast milk is already doing the most important thing: showing up, feeding their baby, and seeking help when needed.</p>
